<h3><u>Matam Karo Shabbir Ka</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><p  'Times New Roman'; line-height: normal; font-size: medium; ""><font size=""4"">(Hayya Ala Khairil Amal) x6<br></font><span class=""Apple-style-span""  large; "">(Matam karo Shabbir ka Zahra ki lo dua) x2<br></span><span class=""Apple-style-span""  large; "">(Is se milega momino(n)) x2 jannat ka rasta</span></p><p  'Times New Roman'; line-height: normal; font-size: medium; ""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  large; "">(Hayya Ala Khairil Amal) x2 (Matam karo Shabbir ka Zahra ki lo dua) x2<br></span><span class=""Apple-style-span""  large; "">Matam he ye usi ka jo nabiyon ka naaz hai<br></span><span class=""Apple-style-span""  large; "">Sadqe mein jiske aaj bhi qayam namaaz hai<br></span><span class=""Apple-style-span""  large; "">(Hayya Ala Khairil Amal) x2<br>Jisne sulagti ret pe sajda kiya ada<br></span><span class=""Apple-style-span""  large; "">Is se milega mominon jannat ka rasta<br></span><span class=""Apple-style-span""  large; "">(Matam karo Shabbir ka Zahra ki lo dua) x2<br><br>1. Matam hai uska jisne watan chora ghar diya<br></span><span class=""Apple-style-span""  large; "">Jisne saro(n) se deen ka kashkol bhar diya<br></span><span class=""Apple-style-span""  large; "">(Hayya Ala Khairil Amal) x2<br></span><span class=""Apple-style-span""  large; "">Jisne jalaya khun se islam ka diya<br></span><span class=""Apple-style-span""  large; "">Is se milega mominon jannat ka rasta<br></span><span class=""Apple-style-span""  large; "">(Matam karo Shabbir ka Zahra ki lo dua) x2<br></span><span class=""Apple-style-span""  large; ""><br></span></p><p  'Times New Roman'; line-height: normal; font-size: medium; ""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  large; "">2. Matam hai uska jispe qayamat guzar gayi<br></span><span class=""Apple-style-span""  large; "">Bhai ki laash par bhi jo matam na karsaki<br></span><span class=""Apple-style-span""  large; "">(Hayya Ala Khairil Amal) x2<br></span><span class=""Apple-style-span""  large; "">Ghurbat pe jiski shaam ka zindan rodiya<br></span><span class=""Apple-style-span""  large; "">Is se milega mominon jannat ka rasta<br></span><span class=""Apple-style-span""  large; "">(Matam karo Shabbir ka Zahra ki lo dua) x2<br></span><span class=""Apple-style-span""  large; ""><br></span></p><p  'Times New Roman'; line-height: normal; font-size: medium; ""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  large; "">3. Azmat jo puchhte ho to qura(n) se puchhlo<br></span><span class=""Apple-style-span""  large; "">Qurbani uski shame gharibaa(n) se puchhlo<br></span><span class=""Apple-style-span""  large; "">(Hayya Ala Khairil Amal) x2<br></span><span class=""Apple-style-span""  large; "">Jisne bachake deen ko sab kuch luta diya<br></span><span class=""Apple-style-span""  large; "">Is se milega mominon jannat ka rasta<br></span><span class=""Apple-style-span""  large; "">(Matam karo Shabbir ka Zahra ki lo dua) x2<br></span><span class=""Apple-style-span""  large; ""><br></span></p><p  'Times New Roman'; line-height: normal; font-size: medium; ""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  large; "">4. Aal-e-nabi ke gham ke siwa koi gham na ho<br></span><span class=""Apple-style-span""  large; "">""jawwad"" ya hussain ki awaz kam na ho<br></span><span class=""Apple-style-span""  large; "">(Hayya Ala Khairil Amal) x2<br></span><span class=""Apple-style-span""  large; "">Matam ali ke laal ka jari rahe sada<br></span><span class=""Apple-style-span""  large; "">Is se milega mominon jannat ka rasta<br></span><span class=""Apple-style-span""  large; "">(Hayya Ala Khairil Amal) x6<br></span></p></p>
                 
                